WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,500
Jianguo Tieshu will help you weigh the weight.

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:09,330
Jianguo, you sold the fish tags to me directly together.

3
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:10,730
Or take it home yourself

4
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,860
Before you sell this fish maw, you need to weigh it first.

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,860
Let’s discuss this issue later

6
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,060
A thief I ask me now

7
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,620
I just want to see if I can receive the fish tag and then use this

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,980
Determine the price of the Wolf Tooth Fan

9
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,700
Who would have thought that he could read my mind

10
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,780
It will be useless to counter

11
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,500
Forget it, I'd better save my life.

12
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:26,940
Twenty-five pounds of wolf tooth fan

13
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,860
The quality you got this time is almost the same.

14
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,300
I'll give you a fixed price

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:36,170
Four yuan per catty. If it works, just do it.

16
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,950
What about the fish tags? Do you want to sell them?

17
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,010
My mother is not in good health Xiaoyue

18
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,130
After getting rid of three ducks in our house, another one is short of milk.

19
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,650
I decided to keep the fish mark

20
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:53,150
As expected, I gave them both step by step

21
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,590
No expectations, no disappointments
